~ start

Ollie: The water's at the stairs! The window, now!
Noni: It's too high! I can't reach the ledge!
Ollie: I'll lift you. Hold on to me.

if Inventory.has_item("rope")
	Ollie: The rope. Good thing I grabbed it.
	Ollie: Tie it around your waist. I won't let you fall.
else
	Ollie: No rope. I never thought to bring one...
	Ollie: Okay. Okay. Then I'll have to pull you up myself.

Noni: Ollie... the roof is slippery.
Ollie: Look at me, not down. Ready?

=> END